# The art pipeline's takes. ComfyUI writes every roll of every sheet here
# (`name-t1.png`, `name-lora0.35.png`, `style*`, `sz-*` ...) and a hundred of
# them weigh seventy megabytes. What the game is cut from is kept: one source
# per sheet in the atlas, under the sheet's own name, plus the two the house
# mark comes from. Everything else is a take that lost.
assets/art/raw/*
!assets/art/raw/cooks.png
!assets/art/raw/crowd-a.png
!assets/art/raw/crowd-b.png
!assets/art/raw/cust-01.png
